# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Brand: MOVEX

Tagline: Moving Things Together.

Concept:

MOVEX is an AI-powered parcel delivery platform connecting people who want to send parcels with individuals and transport providers already travelling towards their destination.

The platform makes parcel delivery affordable, accessible, convenient and reliable by utilising existing journeys and different transportation modes.

Two delivery models:

A. COMMUNITY RELAY

- People travelling towards a destination carry parcels.
- The platform matches parcels with existing travel routes.
- AI suggests convenient pickup and drop-off points.
- Sender and delivery partner mutually agree on meeting points.
- Delivery partners earn money for carrying parcels.
- No dedicated journey should be created solely for a Community Relay parcel.

B. PREMIUM EXPRESS

- A dedicated delivery partner handles the entire delivery.
- Doorstep pickup and delivery.
- Faster and more convenient service.
- Higher delivery charges.

