## 6.2 Pricing formula

Calculate:

Final Price =

Base Fare
+ Distance Charge
+ Weight Charge
+ Dimension Charge
+ Delivery Model Charge
+ Urgency Charge
+ Platform Fee.

Use separate rates for each transportation mode.

